#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:9
msgid "Backends and Presets"
msgstr "后端与预设"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:13
msgid ""
"This page is the source of truth for the ``isaaclab-selecting-backends`` and"
" ``isaaclab-using-presets`` agent skills (`skills/user/select-backends/ "
"<../../../skills/user/select-backends/SKILL.md>`__, `skills/user/use-"
"presets/ <../../../skills/user/use-presets/SKILL.md>`__). When you change "
"this page, update those skills so agent guidance stays in sync. See "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills`."
msgstr ""
"本页是 ``isaaclab-selecting-backends`` 和 ``isaaclab-using-presets`` 智能体技能的权威依据（"
" `skills/user/select-backends/ <../../../skills/user/select-"
"backends/SKILL.md>`__ 、 `skills/user/use-presets/ <../../../skills/user/use-"
"presets/SKILL.md>`__ ）。修改本页时，请同步更新这些技能，保证智能体指导与文档一致。请参阅 "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:20
msgid ""
"An Isaac Lab environment describes the robot, scene, sensors, and task. A "
"**backend** supplies the physics or rendering implementation that brings "
"that description to life. A **preset** is a named, tested configuration "
"choice that lets you switch implementations or task modes without editing "
"Python."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 环境描述机器人、场景、传感器和任务。 **后端** 提供使这些描述实际运行起来的物理或渲染实现。 **预设** "
"是具有名称、经过测试的配置选项，可在不修改 Python 代码的情况下切换实现或任务模式。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:25
msgid ""
"In practice, the same environment can run with a different physics engine, "
"renderer, or observation mode by adding a short selector:"
msgstr "实际使用时，只需添加一个简短的选择器，就能让同一环境使用不同的物理引擎、渲染器或观测模式："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:33
msgid ""
"The task stays ``Isaac-Cartpole-Direct``. The preset changes the "
"configuration used to launch it."
msgstr "任务仍是 ``Isaac-Cartpole-Direct`` ，预设改变的是启动任务时使用的配置。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:38
msgid "The mental model"
msgstr "理解环境与预设"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:40
msgid ""
"Think of an environment as the experiment and presets as the knobs that "
"select tested versions of its larger building blocks:"
msgstr "可以将环境看作实验，将预设看作用于选择其主要组件配置的开关；这些配置均经过测试："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:50
msgid ""
"After configuration is resolved, Isaac Lab's common asset, sensor, and scene"
" APIs dispatch to the selected backend implementation. Environment code can "
"use the same public API across PhysX, Newton, and OvPhysX instead of "
"branching on the active engine throughout the task."
msgstr ""
"配置解析完成后，Isaac Lab 通用的资源、传感器和场景 API 会调用选定的后端实现。环境代码可以跨 PhysX、Newton 和 OvPhysX"
" 使用相同的公共 API，无需在任务各处根据当前引擎编写分支。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:55
msgid ""
"Physics, rendering, and visualization are separate choices. For example, a "
"camera environment can use Newton physics with the Newton Warp renderer, "
"while the visualizer is selected independently with ``--viz``."
msgstr ""
"物理、渲染和可视化可以分别选择。例如，相机环境可以使用 Newton 物理与 Newton Warp 渲染器，再通过 ``--viz`` "
"独立选择可视化器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:63
msgid "Backend architecture"
msgstr "后端架构"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:65
msgid ""
"Factories dispatch an object to the active backend implementation at "
"construction time, so code can use the same public API without importing "
"backend-specific modules directly."
msgstr "工厂在对象构造时将其分派给当前后端的具体实现，因此上层代码可以使用统一的公共 API，无需直接导入各后端的专用模块。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:69
#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:75
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab backend architecture, from environment code through factories and the physics\n"
"preset to the PhysX, Newton, and OvPhysX backend packages and their engines"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 后端架构：环境代码通过工厂和物理预设，连接到 PhysX、Newton、OvPhysX 后端软件包及其底层引擎。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:82
msgid "Factory dispatch"
msgstr "工厂分派"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:84
msgid ""
"All factories inherit from "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.backend_utils.FactoryBase`. They locate supported "
"backend implementations through a core backend-key selector followed by "
"package and module-path conventions:"
msgstr ""
"所有工厂均继承 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.backend_utils.FactoryBase` "
"，先通过核心后端键选择器，再按照软件包和模块路径约定，定位受支持的后端实现："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:88
msgid ""
"The name of ``SimulationContext.physics_manager`` is mapped to one of the "
"backend keys recognized by ``FactoryBase._get_backend()``. Adding another "
"physics backend requires extending this core selector."
msgstr ""
"``SimulationContext.physics_manager`` 的名称会映射到 ``FactoryBase._get_backend()``"
" 识别的某个后端键。添加新的物理后端时，需要扩展这个核心选择器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:91
msgid ""
"The factory module path determines the backend module path. For example, "
"``isaaclab.assets.articulation`` maps to "
"``isaaclab_physx.assets.articulation``, "
"``isaaclab_newton.assets.articulation``, or "
"``isaaclab_ov.assets.articulation``. The OvPhysX backend key uses the shared"
" ``isaaclab_ov`` integration package."
msgstr ""
"工厂模块路径决定后端模块路径。例如， ``isaaclab.assets.articulation`` 映射到 "
"``isaaclab_physx.assets.articulation`` 、 "
"``isaaclab_newton.assets.articulation`` 或 "
"``isaaclab_ov.assets.articulation`` 。OvPhysX 后端键使用共享的 ``isaaclab_ov`` 集成软件包。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:97
msgid ""
"The factory lazily imports the backend module and caches the implementation "
"class in a registry."
msgstr "工厂按需导入后端模块，并将实现类缓存到注册表中。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:118
msgid ""
"Renderers and visualizers instead select their implementations through their"
" configuration's ``class_type``. Their selection is independent of physics; "
"renderer instances are shared through the simulation registry described "
"below."
msgstr "渲染器和可视化器则通过配置中的 ``class_type`` 选择实现。它们的选择独立于物理后端；渲染器实例通过下文介绍的仿真注册表共享。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:123
msgid "Physics manager lifecycle"
msgstr "物理管理器生命周期"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:125
msgid ""
"Each backend implements :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsManager`, the "
"abstract base class that owns its simulation lifecycle. Implementations "
"initialize their engine from a :class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationContext`, "
"update kinematics with ``forward()``, advance simulation with ``step()``, "
"reset state with ``reset()``, and release resources with ``close()``."
msgstr ""
"各后端均实现 :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsManager` 。这一抽象基类负责管理仿真生命周期。具体实现根据 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationContext` 初始化引擎，通过 ``forward()`` 更新运动学、 "
"``step()`` 推进仿真、 ``reset()`` 重置状态，并通过 ``close()`` 释放资源。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:131
msgid ""
"The manager exposes :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsEvent` callbacks for "
"cross-backend lifecycle work. ``MODEL_INIT`` occurs during scene "
"construction, ``PHYSICS_READY`` after physics initialization, and ``STOP`` "
"before native resources are replaced or shut down. The concrete ``close()`` "
"implementation dispatches the ``STOP`` event."
msgstr ""
"管理器通过 :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsEvent` 回调处理跨后端的生命周期操作。 ``MODEL_INIT``"
" 在场景构建期间触发， ``PHYSICS_READY`` 在物理初始化完成后触发， ``STOP`` 在原生资源被替换或关闭之前触发。具体的 "
"``close()`` 实现负责派发 ``STOP`` 事件。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:137
msgid ""
"``SimulationContext`` owns native resources and renderer instances in one "
"registry. ``get_or_create_backend(backend_cfg)`` reuses one resource for "
"equal configurations of the same concrete type; a cache miss constructs "
"``instantiate(backend_cfg)``. :class:`~isaaclab.sim.BackendCfg` describes "
"resource settings and identity, and :class:`~isaaclab.renderers.RendererCfg`"
" extends it for renderer instances. ``PhysicsCfg`` selects a physics "
"manager. Finalize configurations before registration and treat them, "
"including nested values, as read-only afterward. Use a new configuration for"
" different settings. ``close_backend(backend)`` closes the exact registered "
"object after all consumers have released their bindings; it does not compare"
" or hash configurations. Resources declared through ``BackendCfg`` must "
"implement ``close()``. Plain construction cfgs share Python-owned data "
"without a teardown operation; removing the registry entry releases its "
"reference. A failed close retains the entry for retry. After physics "
"shutdown invalidates camera render data, simulation teardown closes material"
" writers, renderer instances, visualizers, and remaining native resources, "
"in that order, before closing the stage."
msgstr ""
"``SimulationContext`` 在同一个注册表中持有原生资源和渲染器实例。对于具体类型相同、配置相等的对象， "
"``get_or_create_backend(backend_cfg)`` 会复用同一资源；缓存未命中时，通过 "
"``instantiate(backend_cfg)`` 创建资源。 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.BackendCfg` "
"描述资源设置和身份， :class:`~isaaclab.renderers.RendererCfg` 在此基础上描述渲染器实例， "
"``PhysicsCfg`` 则选择物理管理器。注册前应完成配置，注册后将配置及其嵌套值视为只读；需要不同设置时，应创建新配置。所有使用方释放绑定后， "
"``close_backend(backend)`` 会关闭那个确切的已注册对象，不会比较配置或计算其哈希。通过 ``BackendCfg`` "
"声明的资源必须实现 ``close()`` 。普通构造配置共享由 Python "
"管理的数据，没有显式关闭操作；移除注册表条目即可释放其引用。如果关闭失败，条目会保留以便重试。物理关闭使相机渲染数据失效后，仿真清理会依次关闭材质写入器、渲染器实例、可视化器和其余原生资源，最后关闭"
" USD 舞台。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:154
msgid ""
"Managers and native renderers expose their borrowed resource through "
"``backend``. For example, ``NewtonManager.backend.model`` accesses the "
"finalized native model. Closing a renderer releases its bindings, not the "
"shared native resource. Exposing native handles does not replace SDP "
"transport."
msgstr ""
"管理器和原生渲染器通过 ``backend`` 暴露借用的资源。例如， ``NewtonManager.backend.model`` "
"可访问最终构建完成的原生模型。关闭渲染器只会释放其绑定，不会关闭共享原生资源。暴露原生句柄并不替代 SDP 数据传输。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:159
msgid ""
"Clone contexts are registered separately as ``sim.clone_contexts[Context] = "
"Context(...)`` before plan dispatch. They apply the plan but do not own "
"native runtime resources."
msgstr ""
"克隆上下文在执行计划分派前，单独以 ``sim.clone_contexts[Context] = Context(...)`` "
"注册。它们负责应用计划，不持有原生运行时资源。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:162
msgid ""
"Newton has two resources with different lifetimes, not two interchangeable "
"backends:"
msgstr "Newton 有两类生命周期不同的资源，它们并非两个可互换的后端："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:164
msgid ""
"``ModelBuilder`` holds mutable construction data. Cloning populates it and "
"sensors declare requirements before finalization. It remains available for "
"hard reset. ``NewtonBuilderCfg`` is a plain construction cfg, not a "
"``BackendCfg``; the builder needs no native ``close()``."
msgstr ""
"``ModelBuilder`` 持有可修改的构建数据。克隆时填充这些数据，传感器在模型最终构建完成之前声明需求；之后构建器仍保留，用于硬重置。 "
"``NewtonBuilderCfg`` 是普通构造配置，而不是 ``BackendCfg`` ，构建器无需原生 ``close()`` 操作。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:167
msgid ""
"``NewtonBackend`` owns the finalized model and native buffers. Physics and "
"render consumers borrow those handles. Closing it releases runtime "
"allocations without closing the builder."
msgstr ""
"``NewtonBackend`` 持有最终构建完成的模型和原生缓冲区，物理与渲染使用方借用这些句柄。关闭它会释放运行时分配的资源，但不会关闭构建器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:170
msgid "Both resources use the same registry:"
msgstr "两类资源使用相同的注册表："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:180
msgid ""
"Both configurations use the selected physics cfg; non-Newton physics selects"
" a render-only representation. ``SimulationContext`` has no backend-specific"
" cfg fields, and consumers do not access clone contexts. Consumers request "
"body transforms and visual points directly through SDP. Queries share the "
"native resource's BVHs but keep each consumer's captured work separate."
msgstr ""
"两种配置均使用选定的物理配置；物理后端不是 Newton 时，则选用仅用于渲染的表示。 ``SimulationContext`` "
"没有特定后端专用的配置字段，使用方也不访问克隆上下文，而是直接通过 SDP 请求刚体变换和可视点。查询共享原生资源的 "
"BVH，但各使用方捕获的计算工作相互独立。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:186
msgid "Portable asset and sensor interfaces"
msgstr "可跨后端使用的资源与传感器接口"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:188
msgid "Assets and sensors use the same layering as the factories:"
msgstr "资源和传感器采用与工厂相同的分层方式："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:190
msgid ""
"A base class in ``isaaclab`` defines the public contract, such as "
"``BaseArticulation`` or ``BaseContactSensor``."
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab`` 中的基类定义公共接口约定，例如 ``BaseArticulation`` 或 ``BaseContactSensor`` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:192
msgid ""
"A factory class inherits from both :class:`FactoryBase "
"<isaaclab.utils.backend_utils.FactoryBase>` and that base class."
msgstr ""
"工厂类同时继承 :class:`FactoryBase <isaaclab.utils.backend_utils.FactoryBase>` "
"和相应基类。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:194
msgid "Backend packages provide the supported implementations."
msgstr "后端软件包提供受支持的具体实现。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:196
msgid ""
"Sensor data classes use the same pattern, for example "
"``ContactSensorData(FactoryBase, BaseContactSensorData)``. Implementations "
"expose :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` values through public asset "
"and sensor data properties. Each proxy wraps the underlying ``wp.array`` and"
" provides explicit ``.warp`` access to that array and cached, zero-copy "
"``.torch`` access to a :class:`torch.Tensor` view. Use those accessors when "
"an API specifically requires one representation. Passing a ``ProxyArray`` to"
" ``wp.to_torch()`` is supported only by a deprecated compatibility shim; new"
" code should use ``proxy_array.torch``. Backend-native and internal storage "
"may still use raw Warp arrays. See :doc:`/source/how-to/proxy_array` for "
"usage and buffer lifetime guidance."
msgstr ""
"传感器数据类也采用相同模式，例如 ``ContactSensorData(FactoryBase, "
"BaseContactSensorData)``。各实现通过公共资产和传感器数据属性提供 "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` 值。每个代理封装底层 ``wp.array``，通过 "
"``.warp`` 显式访问该数组，并通过 ``.torch`` 访问缓存的零拷贝 :class:`torch.Tensor` 视图。API "
"明确要求某种表示形式时，请使用对应的访问器。将 ``ProxyArray`` 传给 ``wp.to_torch()`` "
"仅由已弃用的兼容层支持，新代码应使用 ``proxy_array.torch``。后端原生接口和内部存储仍可能使用原始 Warp "
"数组。用法和缓冲区生命周期见 :doc:`/source/how-to/proxy_array` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:209
msgid "Portable renderer and scene-data interfaces"
msgstr "可跨后端使用的渲染器与场景数据接口"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:211
msgid ""
"Rendering is selected independently from physics. Acquire implementations of"
" the :class:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer` contract through "
"``sim.get_or_create_backend(renderer_cfg)``. The "
":class:`~isaaclab.renderers.RenderContext` coordinates their rendering "
"lifecycle through a filtered view of that registry, without a separate "
"renderer cache or renderer ownership. It validates global settings and "
"registration timing, initializes renderers after physics is ready, and "
"coordinates stage preparation, scene updates, and material writers. See "
":ref:`overview_renderers` for renderer choices and usage."
msgstr ""
"渲染器的选择独立于物理后端。通过 ``sim.get_or_create_backend(renderer_cfg)`` 获取符合 "
":class:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer` 接口约定的实现。 "
":class:`~isaaclab.renderers.RenderContext` "
"通过注册表的过滤视图协调渲染生命周期，不另设渲染器缓存，也不持有渲染器所有权。它验证全局设置和注册时机，在物理就绪后初始化渲染器，并协调 USD "
"舞台准备、场景更新和材质写入器。渲染器选择与用法见 :ref:`overview_renderers` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:221
msgid ""
"Physics managers expose live simulation data through "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataBackend`. The "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` owned by the simulation "
"context converts and remaps that data for backend-independent consumers:"
msgstr ""
"物理管理器通过 :class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataBackend` 暴露实时仿真数据。仿真上下文持有的 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` 负责转换和重新映射数据，供不依赖具体后端的使用方消费："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:230
msgid ""
"This boundary lets renderers and visualizers consume a common Warp-native "
"data path without knowing which physics engine owns the state. See "
":doc:`/source/concepts/native-physics-api/scene_data_providers` for the "
"complete data-flow model."
msgstr ""
"通过这一接口边界，渲染器和可视化器可以共用 Warp 原生数据通路，无需了解状态由哪个物理引擎管理。完整的数据流模型见 "
":doc:`/source/concepts/native-physics-api/scene_data_providers` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:236
msgid "Native engine access boundary"
msgstr "原生引擎访问边界"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:238
msgid ""
"The portable interfaces define the stable API boundary. Advanced code can "
"use each engine's native low-level data API, but those APIs intentionally "
"keep their own ownership and synchronization semantics. See "
":doc:`/source/concepts/native-physics-api/index` for PhysX typed views, "
"Newton live model/state arrays and generic selections, and OvPhysX tensor "
"bindings."
msgstr ""
"可跨后端使用的接口构成稳定的 API 边界。高级代码可以使用各引擎的原生底层数据 API，但这些 API 保留各自的所有权和同步语义。PhysX "
"类型化视图、Newton 实时模型与状态数组及通用选择，以及 OvPhysX 张量绑定，见 :doc:`/source/concepts/native-"
"physics-api/index` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:246
msgid "Design principles"
msgstr "设计原则"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:248
msgid ""
"**Lazy loading:** Backend modules are imported only when first instantiated,"
" keeping startup fast and avoiding dependencies on unused backends."
msgstr "**按需加载：** 后端模块仅在首次实例化时导入，既加快启动，也避免依赖未使用的后端。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:250
msgid ""
"**Recognized keys plus convention:** Once the core selector recognizes a "
"backend key, module paths mirror the ``isaaclab.X.Y`` structure. OvPhysX "
"maps to ``isaaclab_ov.X.Y``; other recognized backends use "
"``isaaclab_<backend>.X.Y`` by default."
msgstr ""
"**已识别的后端键与路径约定：** 核心选择器识别后端键后，模块路径遵循 ``isaaclab.X.Y`` 的结构。OvPhysX 映射为 "
"``isaaclab_ov.X.Y`` ；其他已识别后端默认使用 ``isaaclab_<backend>.X.Y`` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:254
msgid ""
"**Independent selection:** Physics backend, renderer, and visualizer are "
"selected independently."
msgstr "**独立选择：** 物理后端、渲染器和可视化器分别选择。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:256
msgid ""
"**Explicit data interop:** Public asset and sensor data properties return "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray`; its ``.warp`` and ``.torch`` "
"accessors expose the required array representation without copying."
msgstr ""
"**显式数据互操作：** 公共资源和传感器数据属性返回 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` ；通过 "
"``.warp`` 和 ``.torch`` 访问所需的数组表示，无需复制。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:259
msgid ""
"**Zero runtime overhead:** Selection occurs at instantiation time; it does "
"not add dispatch logic to the simulation hot path."
msgstr "**无运行时额外开销：** 实现在实例化时选定，不会在仿真频繁执行的路径中增加分派逻辑。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:264
msgid "Find what a task supports"
msgstr "查看任务支持的选项"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:266
msgid ""
"Preset support is task-specific. Before choosing a name, ask the task what "
"it offers:"
msgstr "不同任务支持的预设有所不同。选择名称之前，先查看任务提供哪些预设："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:274
msgid ""
"The help output groups names by ``physics=``, ``renderer=``, and "
"``presets=``. To list the combinations each registered environment can "
"launch, run:"
msgstr ""
"帮助输出按 ``physics=``、``renderer=`` 和 ``presets=`` 对名称分组。要列出各个已注册环境能够启动的组合，可运行："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:281
msgid ""
"Each line is one combination that resolves, passes the task's own "
"configuration checks, and can launch headless; ``[default]`` marks the one "
"the task uses when no names are passed. Not every pairing of declared names "
"can run together: OvPhysX and OVRTX cannot share a process with Isaac Sim / "
"Kit, and a task can reject a combination in its own configuration checks. "
"Checking every combination takes a few seconds per task, so narrow the list "
"with ``--keyword``."
msgstr ""
"每行对应一种可以完成配置解析、通过任务自身的配置检查并以无界面方式启动的组合；``[default]`` "
"标记未传入名称时任务所用的默认组合。已声明的选项并非可以任意搭配：OvPhysX 和 OVRTX 无法与 Isaac Sim / Kit "
"共处同一进程，任务也可能在自身的配置检查中拒绝某些组合。检查一个任务的所有组合需要几秒钟，建议用 ``--keyword`` 缩小范围。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:289
msgid ""
"A task listed only with ``(defaults)`` uses its registered default "
"configuration and does not expose alternatives. Passing a name that a task "
"does not list is unsupported and fails during configuration validation."
msgstr "如果任务只列出 ``(defaults)``，表示它使用已注册的默认配置，没有可选变体。传入任务未列出的名称不受支持，会在配置校验时失败。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:295
msgid "Choose a selector"
msgstr "选用合适的选择器"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:301
msgid "Selector"
msgstr "选择器"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:302
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:303
msgid "What it changes"
msgstr "修改内容"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:304
msgid "``physics=NAME``"
msgstr "``physics=NAME``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:305
msgid "``physics=newton_mjwarp``"
msgstr "``physics=newton_mjwarp``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:306
msgid "Selects a physics configuration, including its backend and solver."
msgstr "选择物理配置，包括后端和求解器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:307
msgid "``renderer=NAME``"
msgstr "``renderer=NAME``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:308
msgid "``renderer=newton_renderer``"
msgstr "``renderer=newton_renderer``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:309
msgid "Selects a renderer configuration for tasks that produce camera data."
msgstr "为产生相机数据的任务选择渲染器配置。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:310
msgid "``presets=NAME[,NAME,...]``"
msgstr "``presets=NAME[,NAME,...]``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:311
msgid "``presets=rgb``"
msgstr "``presets=rgb``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:312
msgid ""
"Applies task-specific choices such as observation modes, camera layouts, or "
"compatible configuration bundles."
msgstr "应用任务专用选项，例如观测模式、相机布局或兼容的配置组合。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:315
msgid ""
"These are Hydra tokens, so append them without leading dashes. They work "
"with training, playback, and environment scripts that use Isaac Lab's task "
"configuration launcher."
msgstr ""
"这些是 Hydra 配置项，直接追加到命令末尾，不要添加前导短横线。使用 Isaac Lab 任务配置启动器的训练、策略运行和环境脚本均支持它们。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:319
msgid ""
"Selectors can be combined. This command chooses Newton with the MuJoCo-Warp "
"solver, the Newton Warp renderer, and RGB observations:"
msgstr ""
"选择器可以组合使用。以下命令选择使用 MuJoCo-Warp 求解器的 Newton 后端、Newton Warp 渲染器，以及 RGB 观测："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:328
msgid ""
"Only combine values listed for the task. Some physics, renderer, sensor, and"
" observation configurations are incompatible, and the task may reject an "
"invalid combination with a focused error message."
msgstr "仅组合任务明确列出的选项。部分物理、渲染器、传感器和观测配置彼此不兼容，任务可能拒绝无效组合，并给出具体错误信息。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:334
msgid "Common backend choices"
msgstr "常用后端选项"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:336
msgid ""
"The exact list depends on the environment, but these names follow shared "
"conventions:"
msgstr "具体列表取决于环境，但这些名称遵循共同约定："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:339
msgid "Physics presets"
msgstr "物理预设"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:343
#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:364
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:344
#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:365
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:345
msgid "``isaacsim_physx``"
msgstr "``isaacsim_physx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:346
msgid ""
"Concrete Isaac Sim PhysX configuration. This is the default for tasks whose "
"established default is Isaac Sim PhysX."
msgstr "明确指定的 Isaac Sim PhysX 配置，适用于既有默认后端为 Isaac Sim PhysX 的任务。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:348
msgid "``physx``"
msgstr "``physx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:349
msgid ""
"Automatic PhysX-family selection. Isaac Sim PhysX is used when the runtime "
"needs Kit; a configured OvPhysX alternative can be used for fully kit-less "
"runs."
msgstr ""
"自动选择 PhysX 系列实现。运行时需要 Kit 时使用 Isaac Sim PhysX；完全不使用 Kit 时，可以选用已配置的 OvPhysX "
"实现。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:352
msgid "``newton_mjwarp``"
msgstr "``newton_mjwarp``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:353
msgid "Newton physics with the MuJoCo-Warp solver."
msgstr "使用 MuJoCo-Warp 求解器的 Newton 物理后端。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:354
msgid "``newton_kamino``"
msgstr "``newton_kamino``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:355
msgid ""
"Newton physics with the Kamino solver. Support is beta and currently limited"
" to selected tasks and compatible assets."
msgstr "使用 Kamino 求解器的 Newton 物理后端。目前处于测试阶段，仅支持部分任务和兼容资源。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:357
msgid "``ovphysx``"
msgstr "``ovphysx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:358
msgid "Concrete OvPhysX configuration for supported kit-less tasks."
msgstr "明确指定的 OvPhysX 配置，适用于受支持且不依赖 Kit 的任务。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:360
msgid "Renderer presets"
msgstr "渲染器预设"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:366
msgid "``isaacsim_rtx``"
msgstr "``isaacsim_rtx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:367
msgid "Concrete Isaac Sim RTX renderer configuration."
msgstr "显式指定 Isaac Sim RTX 渲染器的配置。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:368
msgid "``rtx``"
msgstr "``rtx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:369
msgid ""
"Automatic RTX-family selection. Isaac Sim RTX is used when physics, "
"visualization, livestreaming, or another runtime choice requires Kit; "
"otherwise OVRTX is used for a fully kit-less run."
msgstr ""
"自动选择 RTX 系列实现。物理、可视化、直播流或其他运行时选项需要 Kit 时，使用 Isaac Sim RTX；否则使用 OVRTX，实现完全不依赖"
" Kit 的运行。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:372
msgid "``newton_renderer``"
msgstr "``newton_renderer``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:373
msgid ""
"Newton Warp renderer. This is the default for tasks that use the multi-"
"backend renderer preset."
msgstr "Newton Warp 渲染器。对于采用多后端渲染器预设的任务，它是默认渲染器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:375
msgid "``ovrtx``"
msgstr "``ovrtx``"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:376
msgid ""
"Concrete OVRTX renderer configuration for supported kit-less workflows."
msgstr "明确指定的 OVRTX 渲染器配置，适用于受支持且不依赖 Kit 的工作流程。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:378
msgid ""
"Automatic selectors such as ``physics=physx`` and ``renderer=rtx`` are opt-"
"in. Defaults are concrete so that running a task without selectors is "
"predictable. A solver is not a separate backend: ``newton_mjwarp`` and "
"``newton_kamino`` both use Newton but configure different solvers."
msgstr ""
"``physics=physx`` 和 ``renderer=rtx`` "
"等自动选择器需显式启用。默认值均明确指定具体实现，保证不传选择器时的任务行为可预测。求解器不等于独立后端： ``newton_mjwarp`` 和 "
"``newton_kamino`` 都使用 Newton，只是配置了不同的求解器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:385
msgid "Defaults, presets, and fine-tuning"
msgstr "默认值、预设与微调"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:387
msgid ""
"A preset replaces the complete configuration section at its location; it "
"does not merge fields from two alternatives. Isaac Lab resolves "
"configuration in this order:"
msgstr "预设会替换所在位置的整个配置部分，而不会合并两个备选配置的字段。Isaac Lab 按以下顺序解析配置："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:391
msgid "Apply each preset config's ``default`` choice."
msgstr "应用各预设配置中的 ``default`` 选项。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:392
msgid "Apply global choices from ``presets=...``."
msgstr "应用 ``presets=...`` 指定的全局选项。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:393
msgid ""
"Apply a preset targeted at a specific path, such as "
"``env.sim.physics=newton_mjwarp``."
msgstr "应用针对特定路径的预设，例如 ``env.sim.physics=newton_mjwarp`` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:395
msgid "Apply scalar Hydra overrides, such as ``env.sim.dt=0.002``."
msgstr "应用 Hydra 标量覆盖项，例如 ``env.sim.dt=0.002`` 。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:397
msgid ""
"The last step makes it easy to start from a maintained preset and tune one "
"value:"
msgstr "最后一步便于在已有维护的预设基础上调整单个值："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:406
msgid ""
"Prefer ``physics=`` and ``renderer=`` for backend choices because they state"
" intent clearly. Use ``presets=`` for task-specific modes or when one name "
"must update several matching sections together. Use a path selector only "
"when you intend to replace one particular section."
msgstr ""
"选择后端时，优先使用 ``physics=`` 和 ``renderer=`` "
"，意图更清晰。任务专用模式，或需要用同一个名称同时更新多个匹配配置部分时，使用 ``presets=`` "
"。只有想替换某个特定配置部分时，才使用路径选择器。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:413
msgid ""
"Keep behavior-changing presets the same when loading a checkpoint. An "
"observation preset can change tensor shapes, and a policy trained with one "
"observation mode may not load with another."
msgstr "加载检查点时，应保持会影响行为的预设与训练时一致。观测预设可能改变张量形状，使用一种观测模式训练的策略，未必能在另一种模式下加载。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:419
msgid "How task authors expose choices"
msgstr "任务开发者如何提供选项"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:421
msgid ""
"Task authors define alternatives with "
":class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.PresetCfg` and choose one as the "
"default. For a multi-backend task, the preset wrapper belongs in "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg`:"
msgstr ""
"任务开发者通过 :class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.PresetCfg` "
"定义备选配置，并选定一个默认值。对于多后端任务，预设包装器应放在 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg` 中："

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:453
msgid ""
"Keep backend-specific values inside named configurations whenever possible. "
"This keeps task logic shared and makes every supported choice visible from "
"the command line."
msgstr "尽可能将后端专用值放在具名配置中。这样可以共享任务逻辑，并让命令行显示所有受支持的选项。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:457
msgid ""
"When backend selection must also change simulation-wide settings such as the"
" time step, a physics preset may instead contain complete ``SimulationCfg`` "
"alternatives. The ``physics=`` selector recognizes these bundles from their "
"``physics`` field and applies the complete matching simulation "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"如果后端选择还必须改变时间步长等仿真全局设置，物理预设也可以包含完整的 ``SimulationCfg`` 备选配置。 ``physics=`` "
"选择器会通过其中的 ``physics`` 字段识别这些组合，并应用完整的匹配仿真配置。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:464
msgid "Where to go next"
msgstr "进一步阅读"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:466
msgid ""
":doc:`/source/setup/environments` lists environments and their supported "
"presets."
msgstr ":doc:`/source/setup/environments` 列出环境及其支持的预设。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:468
msgid ""
":doc:`/source/features/hydra` covers scalar overrides, preset authoring, "
"conflict handling, and advanced configuration behavior."
msgstr ":doc:`/source/features/hydra` 介绍标量覆盖、预设编写、冲突处理和高级配置行为。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:470
msgid ""
":ref:`physics-backends` compares physics backend runtime requirements, "
"maturity, solver families, and intended uses."
msgstr ":ref:`physics-backends` 比较各物理后端的运行时要求、成熟度、求解器系列和适用场景。"

#: source/concepts/backends_and_presets.rst:472
msgid ""
":doc:`/source/concepts/renderers` explains renderer selection and "
"implementation details."
msgstr ":doc:`/source/concepts/renderers` 介绍渲染器的选择与实现细节。"
